    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>9 Games, 2 Buttons!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this arcade-style game you play up to 9 different minigames at the same time, at various game speeds! Levels 1 minute long, runs 10-30 minutes long. You use a pair of keys/controls for each game. Push for a new high score, sweat till your heart's content, trash talk your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features included:</strong><br>9 unique minigames - From a last stand against zombies, to a standoff with a cowboy, to a mini platformer! Scramble to split your attention!<br>4 game difficulties - &quot;Easy&quot; &quot;Normal&quot; &quot;Hard&quot; &quot;Tryhard&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Device local high score board for each difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn level skips by beating high stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute things like a menu gallery of images I like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pricing:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game will be free until may.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>9 Games, 2 Buttons!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this arcade-style game you play up to 9 different minigames at the same time, at various game speeds! Levels 1 minute long, runs 10-30 minutes long. You use a pair of keys/controls for each game. Push for a new high score, sweat till your heart's content, trash talk your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features included:</strong><br>9 unique minigames - From a last stand against zombies, to a standoff with a cowboy, to a mini platformer! Scramble to split your attention!<br>4 game difficulties - &quot;Easy&quot; &quot;Normal&quot; &quot;Hard&quot; &quot;Tryhard&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Device local high score board for each difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn level skips by beating high stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute things like a menu gallery of images I like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pricing:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game will be free until may.</p>",
